### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Actualizar conductor (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/conductores/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Alberto Martinez",
  "description": "Conductor actualizado",
  "company_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Actualizar conductor parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/conductores/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Nueva description parcial"
}
